OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be another mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy and dry day but with some
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells breaking
OL,8,Fthrough. Chance of the odd shower at
OL,9,Ftimes. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mixture of variable cloud
OL,12,Fand some clear spells through the
OL,13,Fevening and overnight. Staying mostly
OL,14,Fdry but the odd possible at times.
OL,15,FLight winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FIt will be a mostly dry day
OL,18,Fwith a mixture of cloud and sunny
OL,19,Fspells. Chance of the odd shower
OL,20,Faround. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
