OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy skies but with some
OL,7,Fsunny intervals. Mostly dry Tuesday
OL,8,Fand Wednesday but the odd light shower
OL,9,Fpossible. Cooler from later Wednesday
OL,10,Fwith showers more frequent and winds
OL,11,Fstrengthening.
